============================================================================
  n=4: Pf(S)=-1  Pf^2=1  det(I+2A)=1  det(S)=1  H=1 (H odd:True, Pf odd:True)
  n=6: Pf(S)=7  Pf^2=49  det(I+2A)=49  det(S)=49  H=13 (H odd:True, Pf odd:True)
  => Pf(S)^2=det(I+2A)=det(S) verified; both H and Pf are ODD (Redei / even-n Pfaffian).

